'''Realm of Carnage (Deadly)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and appears on the '''11th''', '''12th''', '''25th''', and '''26th''' of every month after clearing [[Into the Future]] chapter 1. When clearing the stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is unlockable as a permanent stage once clearing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] from the [[Heavenly Tower]].

