'''Difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' Spam Eraser Cats, Manic Island Cats and Can Can Cats to take care of Bore and heavily damage Hannya. Alternate between sending out Li'l King Dragon and Housewife to fight R.Ost, so that if one dies, the other is off cooldown. Chip down Hannya until victory is yours. Bring [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] to push her back every so often.

