'''Difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' The crux of this strategy hinges on maximizing Courier Cat's value against all enemies. Spawn your anti-Reds against Bore to wipe him out as quickly as possible. Then, for the R.Ost phase, you'll want to meatshield with Bellydance and Green Shell Cat while Courier quickly chips away at him. Once Hannya is alone, swarm her with Couriers. Timing is required for Courier Cat to actually hit Hannya, but with the right amount of luck on Bellydance Dodges and a steady line of meatshields, the enemies will find it very difficult to break through regardless.

