'''Battle:''' Use Bore as a platform to launch Wave Attacks that slowly chip away at Hannya and R.Ost. Roe + Cyberpunk stall the frontline to a standstill if played right, giving ample opportunity to take care of the threats at relaxed pace with Manic Macho Legs and Jellycat. Medalist serves as a decent stackable Long Distance attacker to snipe R.Ost for extra DPS since Bore usually ends up stacking up with him.

