'''Difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' Bait out an attack from Hannya using Neo Cutter Cat at 5,200¢, then use that opportunity to perform a small chain on her with Awakened Bahamut Cat. If done right, this already eats half of her HP. Now get into the following cycle: Use Dark Cat and Maximum the Fighter to kill the Bores; alternate between Pizza Cats and Manic King Dragon Cats to kill the R.Osts. If Bore stacks with R.Ost, send out Mina to gradually snipe the latter in the back. Once the coast is clear, unleash Bahamut, who is likely to get two hits on Hannya before dying, which is more than enough to stagger her. If the second Bahamut wasn't enough to kill her, use Breakerblast to push Hannya even further back and repeat this process one more time. There's just enough income from enemies to sustain this strategy, but remember to deploy units resourcefully; it may take some time to successfully pull off, so cash management is of utmost importance.

